2: //
3: // Ollama may expose an implicitly tagged model as `name:latest` while the
4: // configured role binding stores `name`.  Those two spellings identify the
5: // same logical presence.  Explicit non-latest tags stay distinct, and this
6: // module deliberately does not perform family, size or quantization matching.
7: //
